\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 1. Executive Summary\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Security logs identified 10 failed login attempts followed by one successful login from an unfamiliar IP address (198.51.100.45).\
Following the successful login, a suspicious email-forwarding rule was created and a Finance mailbox message was accessed.\
The activity indicates a possible brute-force attack followed by unauthorized account access.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

